#unnumbered-heading("Abstract")

A short summary of the contents in English of about one page. The following points should be addressed in particular:

- *Motivation:* Why did this work come about? Why is the topic of the work interesting to the general public?
- *Content:* What is the content of this thesis? The methodology and working method should be briefly discussed.
- *Results:* What are the results of this work? Give a brief overview as a teaser for the complete thesis.

A useful guide by Kent Beck on writing good abstracts is available here:

